  "21_22": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"What's less obvious is how it helps develop their concentration. ... Hmm, yeah, I never associated spatial awareness with handwriting either — cả hai đều là điều gây bất ngờ."},
  "23_24": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"I like the idea of using one of those pens that lights up if you press too hard ... One quite simple thing you can do is to use grid paper. So they write each letter in a box and that trains them to space the letters correctly — A: khoảng cách chữ; C: viết quá mạnh tay."},
  "25": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"it's not as frustrating for them if they get things wrong. On a keyboard, they can be more willing to have a go."},
  "26": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"it's been proved that cursive is more difficult to learn, especially for children with learning difficulties who find joining up letters really challenging."},
  "27": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"I was always worried that my poor handwriting affected my exam results, and now research shows that I was right to worry."},
  "28": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"Anyway, teachers understand the value of handwriting. It's a basic life skill."},
  "29": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"my mum is shocked by my awful spelling and the fact that my punctuation is really inconsistent."},
  "30": {"loc":"Part 3","quote":"I hardly ever write anything now. ... Nobody I know would be able to identify my handwriting now. It's a shame — tiếc nuối vì đã mất thói quen viết tay."},
  "31": {"loc":"Part 4","quote":"a lot of damage can be caused to farmers' crops by rodents, such as rats"},
